{"id":"vod_bf_3504","vodId":"3504","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"不管我怎么去想我不受欢迎这件事都是你们的错！","name_cn":"不管我怎么去想我不受欢迎这件事都是你们的错！","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-4/ec7cc2f2c0c9359d38162b5f00aab8df.jpg"},"summary":"原本还算有着可爱的脸蛋，可是不知为何总给人一种阴冷诡异不好接近的感觉。这便是刚刚升入高中不久的黑木智子（橘田いずみ 配音），她蓬头垢面，少言寡语，脸上是极度痴迷游戏后留下的黑眼圈。原本以为自己会成为乙女游戏中众星捧月的校花，谁知却注定要成为没有朋友、无人关注的丧女。更无法忍受的，是初中与之同类型的死党成濑优（花澤香菜 配音）都有了翻天覆地的变化。当然，拥有强大内心的智子绝不会因此自甘沉沦，她暗自嘲笑同学的肤浅与轻浮，在妄想世界里体会着前所未有的快乐。只不过依旧耐不住寂寞，这又化作了自卑、嫉妒和各种恶毒的心语。实在逼到极点，便朝向弟弟智贵（中村悠一 配音）。总之，她之所以变成这样，都怪这个世界和周围人而已……　　本片根据谷川ニコ的同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:59:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/buguanwozenmequxiangwobushouhuanyingzhejianshidushinimendecuo/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/buguanwozenmequxiangwobushouhuanyingzhejianshidushinimendecuo/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/buguanwozenmequxiangwobushouhuanyingzhejianshidushinimendecuo/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/buguanwozenmequxiangwobushouhuanyingzhejianshidushinimendecuo/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/buguanwozenmequxiangwobushouhuanyingzhejianshidushinimendecuo/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/buguanwozenmequxiangwobushouhuanyingzhejianshidushinimendecuo/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/buguanwozenmequxiangwobushouhuanyingzhejianshidushinimendecuo/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/buguanwozenmequxiangwobushouhuanyingzhejianshidushinimendecuo/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/